{"headword":"יָסַף","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. add (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Hiph.; Aramaic Aph. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹסִיף</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܘܣܶܦ</span>; Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">יסף</span>; MI<sup>29</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">יספתי</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:21\" href=\"/Genesis.1.21\">1:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לספת</span>; Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">וסף</span> Hom <sup>ZMG 1892, 530</sup>; Assyrian <em>esêpu</em> dub. (<em>eṣêpu</em> Dl<strong>)—</strong>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָסַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:26\" href=\"/Genesis.38.26\">Gn 38:26</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָֽסְפָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:12\" href=\"/Genesis.8.12\">Gn 8:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיָֽסְפָה</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:30\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.30\">2 K 19:30</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.31\">Is 37:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָסַ֫פְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.15\">Is 26:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.6\">2 Ch 9:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיָסַפְתָּ֫</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.9\">Dt 19:9</a>, etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">סְפוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.1\">Is 29:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.21\">Je 7:21</a>; + Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָסֶ֫פֶת</span> for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">לִסְפּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:14\" href=\"/Numbers.32.14\">Nu 32:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.1\">Is 30:1</a> (Ges<sup>§ 69. 2. R</sup>); Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹסִף</span> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹסֵף</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.14\">Is 29:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.5\">38:5</a> (Kö <sup>i 403</sup> adds <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:18\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.18\">Ec 1:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹסִיף</span>, from form and connexion less likely); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹסְפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.19\">Dt 5:22</a>;—<em>add</em> sq. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.19\">1 S 12:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.21\">Je 7:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 45:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.45.3\">45:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.1\">Is 29:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.1\">30:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.5\">38:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.9\">Dt 19:9</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">עוד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.14\">Lv 22:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.21\">26:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.13\">27:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.27\">27</a>; sq. acc. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:30\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.30\">2 K 19:30</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.31\">Is 37:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:14\" href=\"/Numbers.32.14\">Nu 32:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.6\">2 Ch 9:6</a> sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> (no acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָסַפְתָּ עַל־הַשְּׁמוּעָה אֲשֶׁר שָׁמָ֑עְתִּי</span>); sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> (no acc.) = <em>increase</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.15\">Is 26:15</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יָסַפְתָּ לַגּוֹי)</span>; sq. acc. <em>increase, have more</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.19\">29:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(וְיָסְֽפוּ עֲנָוִים ביהוה שִׂמְחָה)</span>; 14 times sq. inf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:12\" href=\"/Genesis.8.12\">Gn 8:12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא יָסְֽפָה שׁוּב אליו עוֹד</span>, i.e. it <em>did not again