bers 5:7\" href=\"/Numbers.5.7\">Nu 5:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:37\" href=\"/Job.34.37\">Jb 34:37</a> (Elihu), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:7\" href=\"/Psalms.61.7\">ψ 61:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.23\">Pr 16:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.16\">Ez 5:16</a> (v. supr.), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.18\">Ne 13:18</a> + <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.23\">Dt 32:23</a>; sq. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:24\" href=\"/Genesis.30.24\">Gn 30:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.2\">Pr 3:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.11\">9:11</a>; sq. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.7\">1 K 10:7</a> (i.e. thou hast more wisdom and prosperity than is reported); sq. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.22\">Pr 10:22</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהוֹסַפְתִּ֫י עַל־כָּל־תְּהִלָּֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:14\" href=\"/Psalms.71.14\">ψ 71:14</a> (i.e. increase); <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהוֹסַ֫פְתִּי חכמה על כל־אשׁר־היה לְפָנַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:16\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.16\">Ec 1:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הִגְדַּ֫לְתִּי</span>) (i.e. gain more); cf. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:9\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.9\">2:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וְגָדַ֫לְתִּי</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳ לכם תבואתו</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.25\">Lv 19:25</a> (i.e. yield more); <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיּ֫וֹסֶף אַחְאָב לַעֲשׂוֹת לְהַכְעִים אֶת־יהוה</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכֹּל וגו׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.33\">1 K 16:33</a> (<em>did more to provoke</em>); <em>add to, increase</em> (sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span>) no obj. expr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳ על־חטאתנו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.13\">2 Ch 28:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\